    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">ABOUT DEAD DISTRICT</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1772910/extras/6817ff8db46d8654e65932c315c6b93b.avif?t=1692262733\" /></div><br>Dead District is a multiplayer and single-player survival sandbox game in an open world where the player has a wide range of options. The action of the game takes place on an island with various dangers such as traps, wild animals, infected, survivors, ready to kill in order to survive! Embark on an exciting journey, build a shelter, defend yourself, team up with other players! The player has a choice of 4 characters.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1772910/extras/39d0cb9d438f637b9152d2d2a8530182.avif?t=1692262733\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FEATURES:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Multiplayer<br></li><li>Mission system<br></li><li>Weather System<br></li><li>Building System<br></li><li>Quests System<br></li><li>4 \u0421haracters available for selection<br></li><li>Driving<br></li><li>Level System<br></li><li>Open World<br></li><li>Crafting<br></li><li>Day / Night Cycle<br></li><li>Fighting<br></li><li>Farming System<br></li><li>Gathering Resources<br></li><li>Enemies</li></ul><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1772910/extras/a105a81fc1c263b2559138d0d5809927.avif?t=1692262733\" /></div>",
